{"item_id": "a85b85de1cb7f368", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "一个土豆游戏，引爆独立开发者的AI噩梦", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mzaw6KEFf", "project_url": null, "author": "小狗弗里茨", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/431790535", "published_at": "2026-09-24T10:39:38+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-26T09:49:56+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "一个“削土豆”的独立游戏，突然撞上了自己的AI复刻版。\n\n一边说自己的创意被克隆，另一边晒开发过程、否认使用AI。最后，两款游戏一起冲上Steam。\n\n真正让独立开发者头疼的，可能不是创意被抄，而是AI正在把“从一个点子到一款游戏”的时间越压越短。\n\n以后做独立游戏，拼的到底还是创意，还是速度？", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 707349, "danmaku": 68, "favorites": 1426}, "tags": ["游戏杂谈", "AI", "游戏", "独立开发者", "开发者"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1mzaw6KEFf", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mzaw6KEFf", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20260926T094106"}
